<title>UK: Hewlett-Packard prices $200 million bond.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard prices $200 million bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager Goldman Sachs International said on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HEWLETT PACKARD FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    21.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.1625  PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.975    SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
